-- Title: iam profile update + idempotency store
-- Kind: patch
-- Intent: iam_platform_user_lifecycle
-- Touches: iam.update_my_platform_user_profile, iam._idempotency_find, iam._idempotency_store
-- 3-E (2026-10-12): suspend/restore/password-reset of accounts removed from this file.
